#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:4
msgid "v3.0.0"
msgstr "v3.0.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.0.0 is the major **v2 → v3** release. It introduces the **OpenMV Cam M7**"
" (STM32F7) and the new ``nn`` CMSIS-NN neural-network module (replacing the "
"old hard-coded ``find_number()`` / ``classify_object()`` methods), adds "
"**MT9V034 global-shutter** and **FLIR Lepton** sensor support, the "
"``sensor.WVGA`` framesizes, and updates the core to **MicroPython 1.9.4**. "
"Several :mod:`image` / :mod:`sensor` / WiFi behaviors changed — read the "
"breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.0.0 je glavno izdanje **v2 → v3**\\ . Uvodi **OpenMV Cam M7** (STM32F7) i"
" novi ``nn`` CMSIS-NN modul neuronske mreže (koji zamjenjuje stare čvrsto "
"kodirane metode ``find_number()`` / ``classify_object()``\\ ), dodaje "
"podršku za senzore **MT9V034 s globalnim zatvaračem** i **FLIR Lepton**\\ , "
"framesize-ove ``sensor.WVGA`` te ažurira jezgru na **MicroPython 1.9.4**\\ ."
" Promijenilo se nekoliko ponašanja :mod:`image` / :mod:`sensor` / WiFi — "
"pročitajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost u nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:20
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:22
msgid "**OpenMV Cam M7** — new STM32F7 board."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam M7** — nova STM32F7 ploča."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:23
msgid ""
"``nn`` module — CMSIS-NN inference: ``nn.load()``, ``Net.forward()``, "
"``Net.search()``, with a model converter and examples."
msgstr ""
"``nn`` modul — CMSIS-NN zaključivanje: ``nn.load()``\\ , ``Net.forward()``\\"
" , ``Net.search()``\\ , s pretvaračem modela i primjerima."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:25
msgid ""
"**New sensors** — MT9V034 global-shutter (FSIN-triggered) and FLIR Lepton."
msgstr ""
"**Novi senzori** — MT9V034 s globalnim zatvaračem (okidan FSIN-om) i FLIR "
"Lepton."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:26
msgid "**MicroPython 1.9.4** core update."
msgstr "Ažuriranje jezgre na **MicroPython 1.9.4**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the hard-coded ``image.find_number()`` / "
"``image.classify_object()`` were removed, :func:`sensor.sleep` now raises, "
"WINC sockets return real byte counts, ``image.binary()`` returns a new "
"image, and ``find_apriltags()`` is capped at 64K pixels — see the breaking "
"changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** uklonjene su čvrsto kodirane metode "
"``image.find_number()`` / ``image.classify_object()``\\ , "
":func:`sensor.sleep` sada izaziva iznimku, WINC utičnice vraćaju stvaran "
"broj bajtova, ``image.binary()`` vraća novu sliku, a ``find_apriltags()`` je"
" ograničen na 64K piksela — pogledajte promjene koje narušavaju "
"kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:34
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:36
msgid ""
"``nn`` — a new CMSIS-NN neural-network module: ``nn.load(path)``, "
"``Net.forward(img, roi=, softmax=, dry_run=)`` (returns 0.0–1.0 floats), "
"``Net.search()`` for multi-scale/position detection, and ``Net.test()``, "
"plus a CMSIS-NN model converter (``nn_convert.py`` / ``nn_quantizer.py``), "
"bundled CIFAR-10 / LeNet / smile models, and NN / NN-search example scripts."
msgstr ""
"``nn`` — novi CMSIS-NN modul neuronske mreže: ``nn.load(path)``\\ , "
"``Net.forward(img, roi=, softmax=, dry_run=)`` (vraća float vrijednosti "
"0.0–1.0), ``Net.search()`` za detekciju na više mjerila/položaja te "
"``Net.test()``\\ , plus CMSIS-NN pretvarač modela (\\ ``nn_convert.py`` / "
"``nn_quantizer.py``\\ ), priloženi modeli CIFAR-10 / LeNet / smile te "
"primjeri skripti NN i NN-search."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:41
msgid ""
"**Sensors** — MT9V034 global-shutter support (FSIN-triggered snapshot) on "
"the OpenMV 4, an updated FLIR Lepton driver with Lepton snapshot, and the "
"new ``sensor.WVGA`` (720x480) / ``sensor.WVGA2`` (752x480) framesizes."
msgstr ""
"**Senzori** — podrška za MT9V034 s globalnim zatvaračem (snimka okidana "
"FSIN-om) na OpenMV 4, ažurirani upravljački program za FLIR Lepton s Lepton "
"snimkom te novi framesize-ovi ``sensor.WVGA`` (720x480) / ``sensor.WVGA2`` "
"(752x480)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Imaging** — ``image.find_circles()`` gained ``r_min`` / ``r_max`` / "
"``r_step`` keywords (faster Hough), ``find_keypoints()`` and the Haar "
"``find_features()`` now accept RGB images, and ``image.compress()`` / JPEG "
"encoding now supports binary (bitmap) images."
msgstr ""
"**Obrada slike** — ``image.find_circles()`` dobio je ključne riječi "
"``r_min`` / ``r_max`` / ``r_step`` (brži Hough), ``find_keypoints()`` i Haar"
" ``find_features()`` sada prihvaćaju RGB slike, a ``image.compress()`` / "
"JPEG kodiranje sada podržavaju binarne (bitmap) slike."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:48
msgid ""
"**Boot** — ``boot.py`` now runs before USB init so it can override the USB "
"mode (e.g. HID)."
msgstr ""
"**Pokretanje** — ``boot.py`` sada se izvodi prije inicijalizacije USB-a tako"
" da može nadjačati USB način rada (npr. HID)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Examples** — added small/high-res AprilTag examples, an I2C LIDAR-Lite V3 "
"example, and dataset tooling (``augment_images.py`` / ``make_patches.py``)."
msgstr ""
"**Primjeri** — dodani primjeri AprilTag-a malih/visokih razlučivosti, "
"primjer I2C LIDAR-Lite V3 te alati za skup podataka (\\ "
"``augment_images.py`` / ``make_patches.py``\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:54
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:56
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled MicroPython to 1.9.4 (with a pyexec parse/compile/exec "
"revert and PendSV fix); clearer ``fb_alloc`` / ``xalloc`` out-of-memory "
"error messages; suppressed ``nn`` printf noise during network loading; "
"reorganized the repository (examples → ``scripts/``, tools → ``tools/``, "
"Haar cascades → ``ml/``). The ``nn`` module is unavailable on the OpenMV 2 "
"(insufficient flash)."
msgstr ""
"Priloženi MicroPython ažuriran je na 1.9.4 (s vraćanjem pyexec "
"parse/compile/exec i ispravkom PendSV-a); jasnije poruke o pogreškama "
"nedostatka memorije za ``fb_alloc`` / ``xalloc``\\ ; potisnut printf šum "
"modula ``nn`` tijekom učitavanja mreže; reorganiziran repozitorij (primjeri "
"→ ``scripts/``\\ , alati → ``tools/``\\ , Haar kaskade → ``ml/``\\ ). Modul "
"``nn`` nije dostupan na OpenMV 2 (nedovoljno flash memorije)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:64
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:66
msgid "Imaging:"
msgstr "Obrada slike:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:68
msgid ""
"Fixed ``fast_atan2f`` for x≤0 (previously always 0 — re-check blob / line / "
"keypoint angles), ``find_apriltags()`` memory handling (dropped contents and"
" a bad realloc on OOM), binary/bitmap per-bpp row pointers (corrupt binary "
"results), ``find_edges(EDGE_CANNY)`` with an ROI, the ``TO_GS_PIXEL`` macro "
"(integral / morph), bitmap/JPEG streaming for grayscale (bpp==0) frames, the"
" keypoint/blob list ``pop_front``, and ``match_descriptor`` results."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno ``fast_atan2f`` za x≤0 (prethodno uvijek 0 — ponovno provjerite "
"kutove mrlja / linija / ključnih točaka), upravljanje memorijom u "
"``find_apriltags()`` (izgubljeni sadržaj i loš realloc pri OOM-u), "
"pokazivači redaka po bpp za binary/bitmap (oštećeni binarni rezultati), "
"``find_edges(EDGE_CANNY)`` s ROI-jem, makro ``TO_GS_PIXEL`` (integral / "
"morph), bitmap/JPEG strujanje za sličice u sivim tonovima (bpp==0), "
"``pop_front`` liste ključnih točaka/mrlja te rezultati "
"``match_descriptor``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:75
msgid "System and camera:"
msgstr "Sustav i kamera:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"Fixed the USB HID interface/endpoint numbers, dynamically changing the XCLK "
"frequency at runtime, ``Net.forward()`` returning the correct number of "
"outputs, and a hardfault when interrupting script parsing."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeni brojevi USB HID sučelja/krajnje točke, dinamička promjena "
"frekvencije XCLK tijekom izvođenja, ``Net.forward()`` koji vraća točan broj "
"izlaza te hardfault pri prekidanju parsiranja skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:82
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Podrška za hardver i ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:84
msgid "**OpenMV Cam M7 (STM32F7)** — new board."
msgstr "**OpenMV Cam M7 (STM32F7)** — nova ploča."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:85
msgid "**MT9V034** global-shutter sensor (OpenMV 4, FSIN-triggered)."
msgstr "Senzor s globalnim zatvaračem **MT9V034** (OpenMV 4, okidan FSIN-om)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:86
msgid "**FLIR Lepton** — updated driver with snapshot support."
msgstr "**FLIR Lepton** — ažurirani upravljački program s podrškom za snimku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:89
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.9.0 and v3.0.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Promjene API-ja vidljive korisniku između v2.9.0 i v3.0.0. Opseg: Python "
"C-moduli u ``modules/`` i Python biblioteke u ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:94
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Svaka promjena označena je svojim utjecajem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:96
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*velika* — utječe na većinu skripti koje su koristile značajku; morat ćete "
"prilagoditi kôd."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:98
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*manja* — uzak API; utječe samo na skripte koje su ga koristile."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:99
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*ponašanje* — isti API, drugačiji rezultati; ponovno provjerite ugođene "
"skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:101
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_0_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Promjene su grupirane po utjecaju tim redoslijedom. Ako samo želite "
"prilagoditi svoj kôd, prijeđite na :ref:`popis za migraciju "
"<v3_0_0_migration>` na kraju. Svaki hash commita vodi na svoj diff na "
"GitHubu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:108
msgid ""
"``image.find_number()`` / ``image.classify_object()`` removed *(major)*"
msgstr ""
"``image.find_number()`` / ``image.classify_object()`` uklonjeni *(velika)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"The hard-coded ``image.find_number()`` (LeNet) and "
"``image.classify_object()`` (CMSIS CNN) methods were removed in favor of the"
" new ``nn`` module. Replace them with ``net = nn.load('/model.network'); out"
" = net.forward(img)``."
msgstr ""
"Čvrsto kodirane metode ``image.find_number()`` (LeNet) i "
"``image.classify_object()`` (CMSIS CNN) uklonjene su u korist novog modula "
"``nn``\\ . Zamijenite ih s ``net = nn.load('/model.network'); out = "
"net.forward(img)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:115
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `d151f7e38 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d151f7e38>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `d151f7e38 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/d151f7e38>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:120
msgid ":func:`sensor.sleep` / :func:`sensor.reset` raise on failure *(minor)*"
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.sleep` / :func:`sensor.reset` izazivaju iznimku pri neuspjehu "
"*(manja)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:122
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.sleep` and :func:`sensor.reset` now raise an exception on "
"failure instead of returning ``True`` / ``False``. Code that checked the "
"boolean return of :func:`sensor.sleep` must wrap the call in ``try`` / "
"``except`` instead."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.sleep` i :func:`sensor.reset` sada izazivaju iznimku pri "
"neuspjehu umjesto da vraćaju ``True`` / ``False``\\ . Kôd koji je "
"provjeravao logičku povratnu vrijednost :func:`sensor.sleep` mora umjesto "
"toga omotati poziv u ``try`` / ``except``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:127
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7d16d008f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7d16d008f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `7d16d008f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7d16d008f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:132
msgid "WINC sockets return the real byte count *(behavior)*"
msgstr "WINC utičnice vraćaju stvaran broj bajtova *(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:134
msgid ""
"The WINC1500 socket ``send`` / ``recv`` / ``sendto`` / ``recvfrom`` methods "
"previously always returned ``0``; they now return the actual number of bytes"
" transferred. Code that assumed a ``0`` return (or looped/blocked on it) "
"must handle the real counts."
msgstr ""
"Metode WINC1500 utičnice ``send`` / ``recv`` / ``sendto`` / ``recvfrom`` "
"prethodno su uvijek vraćale ``0``\\ ; sada vraćaju stvaran broj prenesenih "
"bajtova. Kôd koji je pretpostavljao povratnu vrijednost ``0`` (ili se na "
"njoj vrtio/blokirao) mora obraditi stvarne brojeve."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:139
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `a07fb2f60 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a07fb2f60>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `a07fb2f60 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/a07fb2f60>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:144
msgid "``image.binary()`` returns a new image *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``image.binary()`` vraća novu sliku *(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:146
msgid ""
"``image.binary()`` gained ``to_bitmap`` / ``copy`` keywords and now returns "
"a new image object instead of returning/mutating the source image in place. "
"Code that relied on ``binary()`` mutating the original image should use the "
"returned object (and pass ``copy=True`` for non-in-place behavior)."
msgstr ""
"``image.binary()`` dobio je ključne riječi ``to_bitmap`` / ``copy`` i sada "
"vraća novi objekt slike umjesto da vraća/mijenja izvornu sliku na mjestu. "
"Kôd koji se oslanjao na to da ``binary()`` mijenja izvornu sliku trebao bi "
"koristiti vraćeni objekt (i proslijediti ``copy=True`` za ponašanje koje "
"nije na mjestu)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:151
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `8a44f0cd9 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8a44f0cd9>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `8a44f0cd9 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/8a44f0cd9>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:156
msgid "``find_apriltags()`` capped at 64K pixels *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``find_apriltags()`` ograničen na 64K piksela *(ponašanje)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:158
msgid ""
"``image.find_apriltags()`` now raises if the image (or ROI) exceeds 64K "
"pixels and returns an empty list for images smaller than 4x4. Downscale "
"large images (use a smaller ``framesize`` or pass an explicit ``roi``) "
"before calling ``find_apriltags()``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_apriltags()`` sada izaziva iznimku ako slika (ili ROI) premaši "
"64K piksela i vraća praznu listu za slike manje od 4x4. Smanjite velike "
"slike (koristite manji ``framesize`` ili proslijedite eksplicitan ``roi``\\ "
") prije poziva ``find_apriltags()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:163
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `bd77afbc0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bd77afbc0>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `bd77afbc0 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/bd77afbc0>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:168
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:170
msgid "For a clean port to v3.0.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Za čistu prilagodbu na v3.0.0 tipičan posao je:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:172
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.find_number()`` / ``image.classify_object()`` with the "
"``nn`` module (:ref:`the nn migration <v3_0_0_nn>`)."
msgstr ""
"Zamijenite ``image.find_number()`` / ``image.classify_object()`` modulom "
"``nn`` (\\ :ref:`migracija na nn <v3_0_0_nn>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:174
msgid ""
"Wrap :func:`sensor.sleep` / :func:`sensor.reset` in ``try`` / ``except`` "
"instead of checking a boolean return (:ref:`the sensor.sleep change "
"<v3_0_0_sleep>`)."
msgstr ""
"Omotajte :func:`sensor.sleep` / :func:`sensor.reset` u ``try`` / ``except`` "
"umjesto provjeravanja logičke povratne vrijednosti (\\ :ref:`promjena "
"sensor.sleep <v3_0_0_sleep>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:177
msgid ""
"Handle real byte counts from WINC socket ``send`` / ``recv`` (:ref:`the WINC"
" socket change <v3_0_0_winc>`)."
msgstr ""
"Obradite stvarne brojeve bajtova iz WINC utičnica ``send`` / ``recv`` (\\ "
":ref:`promjena WINC utičnice <v3_0_0_winc>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:179
msgid ""
"Use the image returned by ``image.binary()`` instead of expecting in-place "
"mutation (:ref:`the binary change <v3_0_0_binary>`)."
msgstr ""
"Koristite sliku koju vraća ``image.binary()`` umjesto očekivanja izmjene na "
"mjestu (\\ :ref:`promjena binary <v3_0_0_binary>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:181
msgid ""
"Downscale images before ``find_apriltags()`` to stay under 64K pixels "
"(:ref:`the find_apriltags cap <v3_0_0_apriltags>`)."
msgstr ""
"Smanjite slike prije ``find_apriltags()`` kako biste ostali ispod 64K "
"piksela (\\ :ref:`ograničenje find_apriltags <v3_0_0_apriltags>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.0.0.rst:184
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
